msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL"
msgid ""
"STEAMWORKS ONLY:\n"
"Maximum number of incoming Steam networking messages processed per poll tick on the server.\n"
"Higher values reduce latency spikes under heavy traffic but may increase CPU usage per frame.\n"
"Lower values improve frame stability but can increase message backlog and delay processing during bursts.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 32–128 (default: 128)"
msgstr ""
"仅限 STEAMWORKS：\n"
"服务器每次轮询处理的 Steam 入站网络消息上限。\n"
"较高值可降低高流量时的延迟峰值，但可能增加每帧 CPU 占用。\n"
"较低值可提高帧稳定性，但可能造成消息积压并延迟突发流量的处理。\n"
"\n"
"推荐范围：32–128（默认：128）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SAVE_FILE_TRANSFER_CHUNK"
msgid ""
"Size (in kilobytes) of each data chunk used when transferring save files over the network.\n"
"Smaller values reduce bandwidth spikes and improve reliability on unstable connections but increase transfer time due to more packets.\n"
"Larger values speed up transfers but may cause higher bandwidth bursts or fragmentation.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 16–256 KB (default: 256 KB)."
msgstr ""
"通过网络传输存档时每个数据块的大小（KB）。\n"
"较小值可降低带宽峰值并提高不稳定连接下的可靠性，但会因数据包增多而延长传输时间。\n"
"较大值可加快传输，但可能造成更高的带宽突发或数据分片。\n"
"\n"
"推荐范围：16–256 KB（默认：256 KB）。"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.HARD_SYNC_AT_CYCLE_START"
msgid ""
"Perform a hard sync at the start of every new cycle\n"
"\n"
"Does not use up your one hard sync per cycle"
msgstr ""
"在每个新周期开始时执行强制同步\n"
"\n"
"不会占用每周期一次的手动强制同步次数"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS"
msgid ""
"How long the server waits (in seconds) for a response from a connecting or loading client before timing out.\n"
"Increase this if your friends take a long time to load into the game.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30. (default: 30)"
msgstr ""
"服务器等待正在连接或加载的客户端响应的时间（秒），超时后将断开。\n"
"如果好友进入游戏需要较长时间，请增大此值。\n"
"\n"
"最小值：30（默认：30）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.PAUSE_SIM_ON_PLAYER_DISCONNECT"
msgid ""
"Automatically pauses the simulation when a player disconnects from the "
"server."
msgstr "玩家与服务器断开连接时自动暂停模拟。"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.SERVER_TICK_RATE"
msgid ""
"How many times per second the server processes incoming network messages.\n"
"Higher values reduce latency but increase CPU and bandwidth usage.\n"
"\n"
"Range: 20–128 TPS (default: 60)"
msgstr ""
"服务器每秒处理入站网络消息的次数。\n"
"较高值可降低延迟，但会增加 CPU 和带宽使用量。\n"
"\n"
"范围：20–128 TPS（默认：60）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL"
msgid ""
"STEAMWORKS ONLY:\n"
"Maximum number of incoming Steam networking messages processed per poll tick on the client.\n"
"Higher values reduce input and state update latency under heavy network load but may increase per-frame CPU usage.\n"
"Lower values improve frame stability but can cause message backlog and delayed processing during traffic spikes.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 8–64 (default: 16)"
msgstr ""
"仅限 STEAMWORKS：\n"
"客户端每次轮询处理的 Steam 入站网络消息上限。\n"
"网络负载较高时，较高值可降低输入和状态更新延迟，但可能增加每帧 CPU 占用。\n"
"较低值可提高帧稳定性，但可能造成消息积压，并在流量峰值时延迟处理。\n"
"\n"
"推荐范围：8–64（默认：16）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS"
msgid ""
"How long the client waits (in seconds) for a response from the server before timing out.\n"
"Increase this if you are timing out while trying to connect.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30. (default: 30)"
msgstr ""
"客户端等待服务器响应的时间（秒），超时后将断开。\n"
"如果连接时经常超时，请增大此值。\n"
"\n"
"最小值：30（默认：30）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.ENABLE_PACKET_QUEUE"
msgid ""
"When enabled, outgoing packets are queued and sent at a limited rate per frame to prevent network saturation.\n"
"When disabled, all packets are sent immediately without throttling."
msgstr ""
"启用后，出站数据包会排入队列，并按每帧限制的速率发送，以防网络饱和。\n"
"禁用后，所有数据包会立即发送，不进行限流。"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND"
msgid ""
"Maximum number of packets to send per second per connection when the packet queue is enabled.\n"
"Excess packets are buffered and sent in subsequent frames.\n"
"\n"
"Ranges: (500 - 1000)"
msgstr ""
"启用数据包队列时，每个连接每秒发送的数据包上限。\n"
"超出的数据包会被缓冲，并在后续帧中发送。\n"
"\n"
"范围：（500 - 1000）"

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.BYPASS_PROTOCOL_CHECKS"
msgid ""
"Ignores protocol version, packet registry fingerprint, and mod version mismatches during connection handshake.\n"
"\n"
"Use this only for cross-platform testing between Debug and Release builds."
msgstr ""
"连接握手期间忽略协议版本、数据包注册表指纹和模组版本不匹配。\n"
"\n"
"仅用于 Debug 与 Release 构建之间的跨平台测试。"

